  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  strings:
  - The UI is final.
  - ':^)'
  - ':dreamed:'
  - Enjoy PITRvania
  - ':V'
  - Armboy ;-;
  - A little Agony never killed anyone
  - 'Tip: Rebuild a level while running it. You''ll get prompted to reload.'
  - .cum is also a valid map format. Don't tell anyone
  - ESC to quit.
  - youtu.be/RCKRk2AiVVk
  - Click the Local button to reload local maps.
  - Now with per-map playtime tracking ^^
